<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Girl Song</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">beabadoobee</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">This Is How Tomorrow Moves</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">37G7NBSwMiZfi3Swzgh4rW</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.433" end="00:24.433">In a way, I'm figuring it out at my own pace</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.185" end="00:34.185">Just a girl who overthinks about proportions or her waist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.371" end="00:39.321">The creases on her face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.321" end="00:47.221">Day like no other, and just another</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.221" end="00:49.735">Bad day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.735" end="00:52.805" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.805" end="01:00.473">All I wanna do is find the words to make it up to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.473" end="01:08.473">Making all the same mistakes, I guess there's still a lot to prove</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.016" end="01:17.016">And there's something I can't say in an ordinary way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.269" end="01:26.202">Day like no other, and just another</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.202" end="01:33.211">Bad day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.211" end="01:41.211" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.314" end="01:52.314">Waking up to hardly recognizing my own face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.818" end="02:01.624">Just a stranger in the mirror thinking, oh, what a shame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.624" end="02:06.875">Didn't think she'd look this way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.875" end="02:10.494">Don't look no different</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.494" end="02:17.596">To how I looked yesterday</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.596" end="02:20.072" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.072" end="02:27.723">All I wanna do is find the words to make it up to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.723" end="02:35.723">Making all the same mistakes, I guess there's still a lot to prove</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.558" end="02:44.558">And there's something I can't say in an ordinary way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.694" end="02:53.611">Day like no other, and just another</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.611" end="02:55.462">Bad day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.462" end="02:58.888" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.888" end="03:02.272">Brain's no good at fighting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.272" end="03:06.106">My hands are tired and I'm out loose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.106" end="03:13.440">And I'm no good at lying, I'm better at denying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.440" end="03:16.792">The consequence that stands</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.792" end="03:21.942">Damn, I need a helping hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.942" end="03:29.843">Day like no other, and just another</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.843" end="03:33.843">Bad day</p></div></body></tt>